{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b> journeying onward.</b> In stages — he would settle here a month or more, then travel on from there and pitch his tent in another place. And all his journeys were southward, to go to the south of the Land of Israel, which is toward Jerusalem, for it is in the portion of Judah, who took in the south of the Land of Israel, at Mount Moriah, which is his inheritance (Bereshit Rabbah)."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:58:25.085482469Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}